    "383 pages : 27 cm",
    "With over 180 pages stuffed with recipes for luscious chocolate treats, simple drop cookies, delectable bar treats and more, this all-inclusive cookie cookbook is sure to satisfy your hunger for freshly baked treats! The Great American Cookie Cookbook features tantalizing full-color photographs, helpful hints, fascinating facts, and countless classic cookie recipes, including",
